  ('Further Mathematics', 'OCR A', 'alevel', '1.1', 'Complex Numbers', 'What is z z* for z = a + bi?', 'a² + b², which is always real and non-negative.', 8),
  ('Further Mathematics', 'OCR A', 'alevel', '1.1', 'Complex Numbers', 'How do you divide complex numbers?', 'Multiply the numerator and denominator by the conjugate of the denominator.', 9),
  ('Further Mathematics', 'OCR A', 'alevel', '1.1', 'Complex Numbers', 'Calculate (3 + i)/(1 − i).', '(3 + i)(1 + i)/2 = (3 + 4i + i²)/2 = (2 + 4i)/2 = 1 + 2i.', 10),
